# Notebooks: readable diffs (nbstripout's textconv, output cells omitted)
# and a filter contributors can wire up locally with `nbstripout --install`.
# The actual guard against committing outputs is .githooks/pre-commit — this
# filter is a convenience on top, not the enforcement mechanism. Activate the
# hook with: git config core.hooksPath .githooks
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout
*.ipynb diff=ipynb
